4. CONFIDENCE -- is the cheap arm's self-report usable 
============================================================================== 
The MAYBE search arm's confidence ROSE as accuracy fell, which made it 
worse than useless. Opus on this tier was the inverse. The test is whether 
a low-confidence verdict is in fact more often wrong. 

  Opus: 
    high    n= 80   established an EIN in the reference: 29 of 80  36.2% 
    medium  n=  9   established an EIN in the reference: 4 of 9  44.4% 
    low     n=  2   established an EIN in the reference: 0 of 2  0.0% 

  Haiku: 
    high    n= 62   established an EIN in the reference: 23 of 62  37.1% 
    medium  n= 25   established an EIN in the reference: 7 of 25  28.0% 
